50,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Candidate A seems safest for the floor and the evening hires.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"A and C both offer the human element visitors want, but A fits the volunteer skill set.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Rin,,C is out because the lab is too busy to handle a working bench! A is perfect.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"B has too many loans, which means paperwork risks. D has too many powered displays. I vote A.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,A is cost-effective and avoids the mount-making trap. I agree with the consensus.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. A is the most considerate choice for the building.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Toshio,,It aligns the visitor data with our available human resources.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Rin,,Yay! Let's go with the textiles!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Kenji,,It's the safest bet for a smooth season.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,A logical conclusion for all parties.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
